  ('2b6c09f7-dbf1-45ea-baf6-9a12e0b12396', 'Renegade Row', 'Lats, Trapezius', 'Get into pushup position gripping some dumbbells. Perform one pushup, then drive your left elbo up, bringing the dumbell up to your body. Return the dumbell to starting position.
Perform another pushup and then row with the other arm to complete one rep.', 'Dumbbell', 'wger', 'CC0', 'fletchgraham', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/490/view/'),
  ('af5a3520-25eb-4dd7-b802-a7382b8ce3ef', 'Rest (for timed workouts)', null, 'When creating a workout based on time, add this to add rest time in the program', null, 'wger', 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'philip', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1114/view/'),
  ('7e74b1f1-636b-4821-b4be-3711328b89b4', 'Retro Treadmill Walking', 'Calves, Quads', 'Controlled treadmill walking performed backward, at a slow and steady speed. A slight incline of about 2 to 3 percent can be added if tolerated.', null, 'wger', 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'Personal routine', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/2549/view/'),
  ('834c639f-4c82-404d-909f-4c75275465a0', 'Reverse Bar Curl', 'Biceps', 'Hold bar with reverse (or "overhand") grip, palms facing the floor.', 'SZ-Bar', 'wger', 'CC-BY-SA 3', 'tuckerm', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/493/view/'),
  ('39c13706-6a8c-4ab5-b605-b9b716665a20', 'Reverse Cable Flye', 'Shoulders', 'Attach D-Handles to two cable pulleys in the upper position. Grab the left on with your right hand and vice-versa.', 'Cable machine', 'wger', 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'Expenses7000', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/1473/view/'),
  ('cf6bf132-fe21-4b70-8f73-006545246f05', 'Reverse Clamshell', 'Glutes', 'Lie on your side with your hips and knees bent, keeping your knees stacked on top of each other. Keep your feet together at first, then keep your knees touching while lifting your top foot upward. Slowly lower the foot back down with control.
Move only through the hip and avoid rolling your pelvis backward. The movement should be small, controlled, and focused on hip rotation.', 'none (bodyweight exercise)', 'wger', 'CC-BY-SA 4', 'TobiasFalk', 'https://wger.de/en/exercise/2448/view/'),
  ('5d8d3581-bce5-4a28-868f-8b299eaedbdd', 'Reverse crunch', 'Abs', '- Lay down
- Place your hands near your butt (often slightly in front or under or both)
- Raise your legs, but about 70% of the way you should be able to also raise your pelvis
